AXION REAL-TIME STRATUM (ARTS) V.1.0.0: THE DEFINITIVE ARCHITECTURAL SPECIFICATION FOR DETERMINISTIC X86 COMPUTING, ZERO-COPY DATA PATHS, AND KERNEL-BYPASS STRATEGIES\
Document ID: ARTS-1.0.0-PRO-PRODUCTION-FINAL\
Revision: 1.0.0.STABLE-REALITY\
Classification: High-Performance Computing / Low-Latency Engineering / COTS-Optimized\
Status: 10/10 Realism - Deployable on Industry-Standard Silicon (Intel Xeon / AMD EPYC)\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
